      "writtenOn": "2026-01-26T15:57:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Deepti.  `pgood_gpio` override of `enable_gpio` has been part of the [fan code](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/175151/4/common/fan.c#131) since 2013.\n\nWhat is the justification for changing this behavior?",
